# Convention: disposable/regenerable working output lives in results/ (or a
# similarly-named per-project dir, e.g. ab-results/) and stays ignored above.
# Permanent deliverables -- final reports, appendices, anything meant to be
# read later rather than regenerated -- live in each project's reports/
# folder instead, which no rule here ever covers. See CONVENTIONS.md.

